1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,554
Fifteen stories, one video:

2
00:00:01,554 --> 00:00:06,100
from three bridges in Keev to the wheat fields in your village, in plain words.

3
00:00:06,550 --> 00:00:09,602
Ten stories in depth first, then five quick hits.

4
00:00:09,602 --> 00:00:10,350
Let's begin.

5
00:00:10,800 --> 00:00:11,448
Story one.

6
00:00:11,448 --> 00:00:17,540
Russia hit three bridges in the Ukrainian capital, Keev, in a huge overnight attack on Friday.

7
00:00:17,990 --> 00:00:23,266
Ukraine's air force counted eighty four cruise missiles and four hundred and four attack drones.

8
00:00:23,266 --> 00:00:24,860
Twenty three places were hit.

9
00:00:25,310 --> 00:00:30,030
The three bridges are the Podilsko Voskresenskyi, the Southern, and the Darnytskyi.

10
00:00:30,030 --> 00:00:32,588
One reopened by about three in the afternoon.

11
00:00:32,588 --> 00:00:36,000
One was still being assessed, and one was partly restricted.

12
00:00:36,450 --> 00:00:37,363
Who is affected?

13
00:00:37,363 --> 00:00:39,189
People in Keev and other cities.

14
00:00:39,189 --> 00:00:44,040
Water, power and heating were cut in places, and the mayor asked people not to drive.

15
00:00:44,490 --> 00:00:46,375
The number of dead is not settled.

16
00:00:46,375 --> 00:00:51,420
Early reports said at least three people were killed, and later reports said at least nine.

17
00:00:51,420 --> 00:00:52,750
Counts differ by source.

18
00:00:53,200 --> 00:00:53,651
Why now?

19
00:00:53,651 --> 00:01:00,020
President Putin had promised a much more painful response after a strike on the Crimean Bridge earlier this week.

20
00:01:00,470 --> 00:01:01,555
What happens next?

21
00:01:01,555 --> 00:01:03,304
No ceasefire has been agreed.

22
00:01:03,304 --> 00:01:08,730
European leaders meeting in Berlin on Thursday asked for a winter truce on energy attacks.

23
00:01:09,180 --> 00:01:09,775
Story two.

24
00:01:09,775 --> 00:01:14,770
Poland says Russian missiles and a drone entered its airspace overnight into Friday.

25
00:01:15,220 --> 00:01:19,205
The defence minister said it was probably two missiles and a drone.

26
00:01:19,205 --> 00:01:21,524
One was a Kh one oh one cruise missile.

27
00:01:21,524 --> 00:01:23,130
He called it a provocation.

28
00:01:23,580 --> 00:01:27,960
Prime Minister Donald Tusk said the objects were Russian and it looked deliberate.

29
00:01:28,410 --> 00:01:32,026
Debris was found on farmland near the village of Molodych.

30
00:01:32,026 --> 00:01:35,891
A loud bang was heard near a railway site in Rudnik nad Sanem.

31
00:01:35,891 --> 00:01:38,010
No damage or deaths were reported.

32
00:01:38,460 --> 00:01:42,400
Air traffic controllers at Rzeszow airport were moved out for safety.

33
00:01:42,850 --> 00:01:43,758
Why it matters:

34
00:01:43,758 --> 00:01:49,510
Poland is a member of NATO, the military alliance of Western countries, and it borders Ukraine.

35
00:01:49,960 --> 00:01:51,078
What happens next?

36
00:01:51,078 --> 00:01:54,060
Investigations are under way at three locations.

37
00:01:54,510 --> 00:01:55,236
Story three.

38
00:01:55,236 --> 00:02:00,200
The Congress party is asking the government for an all party talk on delimitation.

39
00:02:00,650 --> 00:02:05,452
Delimitation means redrawing constituency borders and seat counts after a census.

40
00:02:05,452 --> 00:02:08,950
It decides how many members of Parliament each state sends.

41
00:02:09,400 --> 00:02:11,295
The opposition's four point plan:

42
00:02:11,295 --> 00:02:20,770
keep the Lok Sabha at five hundred and forty three seats, keep each state's share, give women one third of existing seats now, and freeze this for twenty five years.

43
00:02:21,220 --> 00:02:22,063
Who is affected?

44
00:02:22,063 --> 00:02:25,380
Every state, because each state's share of seats depends on it.

45
00:02:25,830 --> 00:02:32,285
Earlier this year a constitution change bill linking women's reservation to delimitation failed in the Lok Sabha.

46
00:02:32,285 --> 00:02:36,970
It got two hundred and ninety eight votes, but needed three hundred and fifty two.

47
00:02:37,420 --> 00:02:43,370
A change like this needs two thirds of members present and voting, so the government needs opposition votes.

48
00:02:43,820 --> 00:02:44,892
What happens next?

49
00:02:44,892 --> 00:02:48,408
The Monsoon Session has stayed open since August, a record.

50
00:02:48,408 --> 00:02:52,400
A winter session is expected in December, but no date is confirmed.

51
00:02:52,850 --> 00:02:53,474
Story four.

52
00:02:53,474 --> 00:02:59,200
The Railway Minister says India's first bullet train service will start in two thousand twenty seven.

53
00:02:59,650 --> 00:03:04,344
Ashwini Vaish nau said it will begin between Surat and Vaapi in Gujarat.

54
00:03:04,344 --> 00:03:08,060
The rest of the Mumbai to Ahmedabad line opens in phases.

55
00:03:08,510 --> 00:03:11,601
The project was announced in two thousand seventeen.

56
00:03:11,601 --> 00:03:16,060
Delays over land and permissions in Maharashtra, and Covid, pushed it back.

57
00:03:16,510 --> 00:03:24,280
As of September, concrete piers stand along four hundred and fifty six kilometres, and viaduct is built for three hundred and seventy one.

58
00:03:24,730 --> 00:03:33,490
In Maharashtra, a twenty one kilometre tunnel is being dug, including seven kilometres under Thane Creek, the country's first undersea rail tunnel.

59
00:03:33,940 --> 00:03:35,538
The train will be India made.

60
00:03:35,538 --> 00:03:41,050
The first body frame of the two hundred and eighty kilometre an hour train is in structural testing.

61
00:03:41,500 --> 00:03:42,481
What happens next?

62
00:03:42,481 --> 00:03:47,770
Track trials are expected by the middle of two thousand twenty seven, and then the first service.

63
00:03:48,220 --> 00:03:48,879
Story five.

64
00:03:48,879 --> 00:03:55,710
The Supreme Court has allowed a lamp to be lit on a hill in Madurai, Tamil Nadu, on the twenty fourth of November.

65
00:03:56,160 --> 00:03:59,594
It is the day of Kar tee guy Dee pam, a festival of lamps.

66
00:03:59,594 --> 00:04:03,560
The lamp is to be lit on a stone pillar on the hill, near a dargah.

67
00:04:04,010 --> 00:04:09,339
The Court paused an order of the Madras High Court, and said this is a one time arrangement.

68
00:04:09,339 --> 00:04:12,930
It cannot be used as a basis to claim the same in later years.

69
00:04:13,380 --> 00:04:17,956
Only authorised temple officials and government officers may go to the site.

70
00:04:17,956 --> 00:04:19,100
The public may not.

71
00:04:19,550 --> 00:04:20,436
The conditions:

72
00:04:20,436 --> 00:04:26,695
no procession, no crowd, no slogans, no new structures, and no interference with the dargah or the mosque.

73
00:04:26,695 --> 00:04:28,230
Security must be adequate.

74
00:04:28,680 --> 00:04:34,650
The Madurai Collector will arrange the lighting, and send a report to the Court within three days of the festival.

75
00:04:35,100 --> 00:04:36,072
What happens next?

76
00:04:36,072 --> 00:04:40,390
The larger questions of religious rights are kept for a later stage of the case.

77
00:04:40,840 --> 00:04:41,494
Story six.

78
00:04:41,494 --> 00:04:47,840
In Rajasthan, the Congress party is ahead of the B J P in village and district council elections.

79
00:04:48,290 --> 00:04:53,810
These are the panchayat samiti, or block councils, and the zila parishad, or district councils.

80
00:04:54,260 --> 00:05:01,730
In block councils, Congress won about three thousand seven hundred seats, and the B J P about two thousand one hundred and eighty.

81
00:05:02,180 --> 00:05:08,450
In district councils, Congress won five hundred and ninety nine seats, the B J P three hundred and one.

82
00:05:08,900 --> 00:05:12,129
Counting took place in thirty seven of forty one districts.

83
00:05:12,129 --> 00:05:16,780
Tallies were still moving, and a later count showed slightly higher numbers for both.

84
00:05:17,230 --> 00:05:18,118
Why it matters:

85
00:05:18,118 --> 00:05:20,724
these councils run village development work.

86
00:05:20,724 --> 00:05:27,060
The Congress state chief asked the chief minister to resign, and the B J P said it will review the results.

87
00:05:27,510 --> 00:05:28,517
What happens next?

88
00:05:28,517 --> 00:05:33,720
Counting in four districts, including Kota and Baran, is set for the seventeenth of December.

89
00:05:34,170 --> 00:05:34,886
Story seven.

90
00:05:34,886 --> 00:05:40,610
The Bombay High Court is thinking about a full ban on selling and making firecrackers in Mumbai.

91
00:05:41,060 --> 00:05:44,907
The two judges said the police are helpless against illegal bursting.

92
00:05:44,907 --> 00:05:48,140
They kept their order for later, so this is not yet a ban.

93
00:05:48,590 --> 00:05:52,041
The court may allow only community displays at fixed grounds.

94
00:05:52,041 --> 00:05:55,040
Reports say the order could cover all of Maharashtra.

95
00:05:55,490 --> 00:05:55,905
Why now?

96
00:05:55,905 --> 00:06:00,880
Reports say there were more than three hundred fires linked to crackers in Mumbai during Diwali.

97
00:06:01,330 --> 00:06:07,013
A petitioner also says some so called green crackers carry fake codes and banned chemicals.

98
00:06:07,013 --> 00:06:10,510
The court asked about licences and green cracker claims.

99
00:06:10,960 --> 00:06:11,827
Who is affected?

100
00:06:11,827 --> 00:06:16,160
Mumbai residents, who breathe the smoke, and the sellers and makers of crackers.

101
00:06:16,610 --> 00:06:17,622
What happens next?

102
00:06:17,622 --> 00:06:19,307
We wait for the court's order.

103
00:06:19,307 --> 00:06:20,600
No date has been given.

104
00:06:21,050 --> 00:06:21,741
Story eight.

105
00:06:21,741 --> 00:06:28,880
The Madras High Court has asked Tamil Nadu how it can drop a twenty seven thousand four hundred crore rupee airport halfway.

106
00:06:29,330 --> 00:06:32,302
The planned airport is at Pah ran door, near Chennai.

107
00:06:32,302 --> 00:06:34,770
It was meant to be Chennai's second airport.

108
00:06:35,220 --> 00:06:38,688
The state government said in August it would drop the project.

109
00:06:38,688 --> 00:06:45,400
Land of more than seventeen hundred acres has already been acquired, and over six hundred and eighty crore rupees spent.

110
00:06:45,850 --> 00:06:50,296
The judges said an airport cannot be built, or dropped, on whims and fancies.

111
00:06:50,296 --> 00:06:53,760
They said studies must have been done before land was taken.

112
00:06:54,210 --> 00:07:00,040
The state's lawyer said much of the land is water body or farm land, so green clearance would be hard.

113
00:07:00,490 --> 00:07:02,018
A citizen filed the case.

114
00:07:02,018 --> 00:07:05,990
He says the decision is arbitrary and no expert report was shown.

115
00:07:06,440 --> 00:07:07,467
What happens next?

116
00:07:07,467 --> 00:07:11,748
The court sent notices to the state, the Centre and the Airports Authority.

117
00:07:11,748 --> 00:07:13,860
The next hearing date was not stated.

118
00:07:14,310 --> 00:07:14,964
Story nine.

119
00:07:14,964 --> 00:07:17,637
Farmers have sown less winter crop this year.

120
00:07:17,637 --> 00:07:20,370
Wheat sowing is down by about fifteen percent.

121
00:07:20,820 --> 00:07:22,781
Winter crops are called rabi crops.

122
00:07:22,781 --> 00:07:28,048
By the thirteenth of November, they covered about one hundred and seventy eight lakh hectares.

123
00:07:28,048 --> 00:07:30,850
A year ago, it was about two hundred and one lakh.

124
00:07:31,300 --> 00:07:35,341
Wheat covered fifty lakh hectares, against fifty nine lakh last year.

125
00:07:35,341 --> 00:07:38,210
Gram, or chana, is down more than twenty percent.

126
00:07:38,660 --> 00:07:38,900
Why?

127
00:07:38,900 --> 00:07:42,869
The monsoon was thirteen percent below normal, so the soil is dry.

128
00:07:42,869 --> 00:07:48,520
Reservoirs and canals are below normal in key wheat states, and wheat needs several waterings.

129
00:07:48,970 --> 00:07:54,338
Late rain also damaged some paddy and sugarcane, and delayed sowing of wheat and mustard.

130
00:07:54,338 --> 00:07:56,630
Some farmers had to sow mustard again.

131
00:07:57,080 --> 00:07:58,645
The gap is shrinking, though.

132
00:07:58,645 --> 00:08:01,830
Two weeks earlier, total sowing was down forty six percent.

133
00:08:02,280 --> 00:08:03,336
What happens next?

134
00:08:03,336 --> 00:08:10,906
The agriculture minister told officials to speed up sowing and urged crops that need less water, like chana, mustard and millets.

135
00:08:10,906 --> 00:08:14,310
The ministry says fertiliser and seed stocks are adequate.

136
00:08:14,760 --> 00:08:15,337
Story ten.

137
00:08:15,337 --> 00:08:20,700
In Chhattisgarh, the government began buying paddy from farmers on the fifteenth of November.

138
00:08:21,150 --> 00:08:24,986
Farmers are paid up to three thousand one hundred rupees a quintal.

139
00:08:24,986 --> 00:08:26,990
A quintal is one hundred kilograms.

140
00:08:27,440 --> 00:08:34,820
That is the support price of two thousand four hundred and forty one rupees, plus a state bonus under the Krishak Unnati Yojana.

141
00:08:35,270 --> 00:08:41,270
More than twenty seven lakh farmers are registered, and about three thousand one hundred buying centres are open.

142
00:08:41,720 --> 00:08:44,842
Each farmer can sell up to twenty one quintals per acre.

143
00:08:44,842 --> 00:08:47,350
Slots are booked through the Tuhar Token app.

144
00:08:47,800 --> 00:08:51,700
The state aims to buy about one hundred and sixty lakh tonnes this season.

145
00:08:52,150 --> 00:08:53,166
What happens next?

146
00:08:53,166 --> 00:08:55,763
Buying goes on until the fifteenth of January.

147
00:08:55,763 --> 00:08:58,980
We did not find an official payment date for this season.

148
00:08:59,430 --> 00:09:00,255
Quick hit one.

149
00:09:00,255 --> 00:09:06,150
Estonia will close its road border crossings with Russia from the first of December, for six months.

150
00:09:06,600 --> 00:09:11,510
Russia called it a new Iron Curtain, and said it will take political and diplomatic measures.

151
00:09:11,960 --> 00:09:12,853
Quick hit two.

152
00:09:12,853 --> 00:09:19,360
India and Japan signed a letter of intent for Japan's forces to train with live fire on Indian ranges.

153
00:09:19,810 --> 00:09:23,950
It is a first, and the training is due to begin in two thousand twenty seven.

154
00:09:24,400 --> 00:09:25,413
Quick hit three.

155
00:09:25,413 --> 00:09:32,250
A SpaceX Dragon cargo capsule left the space station on Friday, carrying science and supplies back to Earth.

156
00:09:32,700 --> 00:09:37,390
It is due to splash down off California on Saturday afternoon, Eastern time.

157
00:09:37,840 --> 00:09:38,763
Quick hit four.

158
00:09:38,763 --> 00:09:45,350
Pakistan beat Sri Lanka by eight wickets in the second Test at Raa wal pin dee, and won the series one nil.

159
00:09:45,800 --> 00:09:49,118
Sri Lanka scored ninety eight and three hundred and sixteen.

160
00:09:49,118 --> 00:09:52,990
Pakistan scored three hundred and twenty five, and then chased ninety.

161
00:09:53,440 --> 00:09:54,393
Quick hit five.

162
00:09:54,393 --> 00:10:02,590
India's National Stock Exchange is now the world's fifth biggest listed exchange by market value, at about sixty billion dollars.

163
00:10:03,040 --> 00:10:06,390
It moved past the Nasdaq and the Hong Kong exchange.

164
00:10:06,390 --> 00:10:09,160
This is information, not investment advice.

165
00:10:09,610 --> 00:10:12,940
That was Trendsplain Daily for the twenty first of November.

166
00:10:12,940 --> 00:10:15,270
Every source is listed in the description.

167
00:10:15,270 --> 00:10:17,490
Subscribe, and we will see you tomorrow.
